ignition/deployments/chain-31337/

# Real-network deployment records (chain-84532) are committed on purpose: they
# record which registry this project deployed to which chain, so the whole team
# shares one registry instead of each clone deploying its own and fragmenting
# agent efficiency history. Ignition also uses them to reconcile re-runs.
